Accept any code signing certificate, not only ones macOS trusts.

Telegram's rules_apple fork (ali-fareed/rules_apple 485016e) carries this one
change on top of upstream; the fake-codesigning certificates are not trusted.

--- a/tools/codesigningtool/codesigningtool.py
+++ b/tools/codesigningtool/codesigningtool.py
@@ -262,7 +262,6 @@
   _, output, _ = execute.execute_and_filter_output([
       "security",
       "find-identity",
-      "-v",
       "-p",
       "codesigning",
   ], raise_on_failure=True)
